WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Standing heavy punch begins the corner route.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.150
The OD Adamant Flame follow-up is cancelled into Level 2.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.500
The Level 2 sequence strikes Ryu in the corner.

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.700
Crouching heavy punch catches Ryu after Level 2.

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.100
Heavy Tatsu continues the post-Super juggle.

6
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:11.300
Ryu recovers after the Tatsu ender.
